  "prefLabel": "Hedc 102.02 Structure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 102.02 Structure.\n\n(a) The commission shall consist of members appointed pursuant to RSA 21-N:8-a, II(a).\n\n(b) The commission shall have a chair and vice-chair, each elected for a 2-year term, with one being a representative of a nonpublic institution.\n\n(c) The chair shall preside over the meetings of the commission.\n\n(d) The vice-chair shall assume the responsibilities of the chair in the chair’s absence.\n\n(e) If both the chair and the vice-chair are absent, the director shall serve as the chair pro-tempore.\n\n(f) The vice-chair shall assume the position of the chair upon the conclusion of the chair’s term, or upon vacancy of the position by the chair.\n\nSource. #14402, eff 10-15-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hedc100.html"
